  Technical case study of the 2023 3CX DesktopApp compromise, covering the cascading X_TRADER-to-3CX supply-chain intrusion, build-system compromise, signed malicious releases, staged payload delivery, victim selection, detection engineering, trust-boundary analysis, and defensive lessons.
